WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.534 --> 00:00:16.428
Sarah: How can we find the kitten's owner?

2
00:00:16.429 --> 00:00:20.165
Ben: I know! We can ask Mrs. Green.

3
00:00:20.166 --> 00:00:23.453
Theo: Mrs. Green lives across from the park.

4
00:00:23.454 --> 00:00:26.375
Skyler: And she knows everyone!

5
00:00:26.376 --> 00:00:31.548
Skyler: She lives in that green house.

6
00:00:31.549 --> 00:00:37.704
Theo: Ha-ha! Mrs. Green lives in a green house!

7
00:00:37.705 --> 00:00:41.278
Riley: Maybe she has a green dog.

8
00:00:41.279 --> 00:00:44.742
Theo: And a green cat!

9
00:00:44.743 --> 00:00:48.165
Sarah: There's one thing I hope she does not have.

10
00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:50.501
Ben: What?

11
00:00:50.502 --> 00:00:52.667
Sarah: A lost kitten!

12
00:00:52.668 --> 00:00:55.883
I want this kitten so much!

13
00:00:55.884 --> 00:00:58.258
Kitten: Meow!

14
00:00:58.259 --> 00:01:04.075
Sarah's mom: Let's go find out.

15
00:01:04.076 --> 00:01:07.987
Ben: Hello, Mrs. Green.

16
00:01:07.988 --> 00:01:09.831
Mrs. Green: Hello!

17
00:01:09.832 --> 00:01:13.828
Sarah: We found this kitten in the park.

18
00:01:13.829 --> 00:01:17.718
Sarah's mom: Do you know who it belongs to?

19
00:01:17.719 --> 00:01:23.270
Mrs. Green: Yes. That kitten lives next door.

20
00:01:23.271 --> 00:01:29.112
Sarah: Oh no. It already has a home!

21
00:01:29.113 --> 00:01:31.436
Mrs. Green: There's Mr. Gump.

22
00:01:31.437 --> 00:01:35.947
He's the kitten's owner.

23
00:01:35.948 --> 00:01:41.100
Sarah's mom: Hello. Is this your kitten?

24
00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:49.925
Mr. Gump: Yes. That's one of my kittens.

25
00:01:49.926 --> 00:01:52.980
Theo: Look, more kittens!

26
00:01:52.981 --> 00:01:59.285
Mr. Gump: I have six kittens.

27
00:01:59.286 --> 00:02:03.269
I'm looking for homes for all of them.

28
00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:07.158
Sarah: I would love to take this one home!

29
00:02:07.159 --> 00:02:09.497
Mr. Gump: That's fine with me.

30
00:02:09.498 --> 00:02:12.431
What about your mom?

31
00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:14.442
Sarah's mom: Hmm . . .

32
00:02:14.443 --> 00:02:22.712
Sarah: Please, Mom?

33
00:02:22.713 --> 00:02:27.771
Sarah's mom: Okay. I think you're ready for a kitten, Sarah.

34
00:02:27.772 --> 00:02:32.951
Sarah: Oh boy! I'm going to name it Pepper.

35
00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:36.774
Sarah: Mittens and Pepper will be friends.

36
00:02:36.775 --> 00:02:38.684
Pepper: Meow!

37
00:02:38.685 --> 00:02:41.177
Chatter: Meow! Meow!

38
00:02:41.178 --> 00:02:50.123
Riley: Hooray! Now the Pet Lovers Club is perfect!
